@startuml
title State - Test Run
[*] --> Created

Created --> Ready : configuration validated
Ready --> Running : start (user)

Running --> Paused : pause (user)
Paused --> Running : resume (user)

Running --> Completed : finished normally

Running --> Aborted : abort (user)
Paused --> Aborted : abort (user)

Running --> Failed : error (system)
Paused --> Failed : error (system)

Completed --> [*]
Aborted --> [*]
Failed --> [*]
@enduml